 </p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
 </article>

 <!-- End CTA -->
 <section class="border-t border-hairline bg-panel py-16">
 <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 <h2 class="mb-4 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
 Ready to ditch the apparel closet?
 </h2>
 <p class="mb-8 text-lg text-ash">
 Let's design a branded company store that fits your crew, your budget, and your HR system.
 </p>
 <a
 href="/contact/"
 class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center bg-gold-500 px-8 py-4 text-lg font-bold text-charcoal transition-all hover:bg-gold-600"
 >
 Get Started
 </a>
 </div>
 </section>
</BaseLayout>
